  "explanation": "The question asks when Arteaga (footballer) began his professional career. The most specific and directly supported answer is \"1 October 2016,\" which is explicitly stated in D1S5 and D3S3 as the date of his professional debut in Liga MX. The other candidates—\"2016,\" \"15/8/2010,\" and \"1990-91 season\"—either refer to different Arteagas (e.g., Manuel Arteaga and Mario Arteaga), are too vague, or describe earlier stages (youth academy) rather than the start of a professional career. Only the specific date of his debut is directly relevant and supported by the original sources."
